---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { services } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Custom Websites, Software & Automation | Rohit Kumar" description="I build custom websites, business software, APIs, and automation for repetitive work. Projects start at $599 and are quoted by scope.">
  <section class="inner-hero service-hero page-shell"><p class="section-kicker" data-reveal><span>02</span> Services / Problem-solving</p><div class="inner-hero-line"><h1 data-reveal>Find the snag.<br /><em>Build past it.</em></h1><p data-reveal>I build websites, software, APIs and custom automations for repetitive tasks, all shaped around the problem your business needs to solve.</p></div><div class="service-artwork" data-reveal aria-hidden="true"><div class="service-art-glow"></div><div class="service-art-core"><span>PROBLEM</span><i>✳</i><span>BUILT WITH</span><b>PURPOSE</b></div><div class="service-art-ring ring-a"></div><div class="service-art-ring ring-b"></div><div class="service-art-tag tag-a">AI + MODERN TOOLS</div><div class="service-art-tag tag-b">BUILT AROUND YOUR BUSINESS</div></div></section>
  <section class="services-detail page-shell"><div class="service-detail-intro" data-reveal><p class="section-kicker"><span>01</span> What can be built</p><h2>Your business has a problem.<br /><em>Let’s solve it.</em></h2><p>Start with what’s slowing the business down or what needs to become possible. That might mean a new product, or automating repetitive work your team does by hand.</p></div><div class="service-detail-list">{services.map((service) => <article class="service-detail-row" data-reveal><span>{service.index}</span><div><h3>{service.title}</h3><p>{service.text}</p></div><b>{service.mark}</b></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="process-section page-shell"><div class="section-heading" data-reveal><div><p class="section-kicker"><span>02</span> The process</p><h2>Understand it.<br /><em>Then build it.</em></h2></div><p class="process-note">I start by understanding the business, then choose the right tools, scope and code for the job.</p></div><ol class="process-list"><li data-reveal><span>01</span><div><h3>I hear the problem</h3><p>I learn about your customers, your goals and what’s getting in the way today.</p></div><b>↘</b></li><li data-reveal><span>02</span><div><h3>I map the right approach</h3><p>I shape the scope, experience and tools around what the project needs.</p></div><b>↘</b></li><li data-reveal><span>03</span><div><h3>I build and refine</h3><p>I keep progress visible and shape the product with your feedback.</p></div><b>↘</b></li><li data-reveal><span>04</span><div><h3>I get it live</h3><p>I prepare the finished work for launch and the people who’ll use it.</p></div><b>↗</b></li></ol></section>
  <section class="pricing-feature page-shell"><div class="pricing-aside" data-reveal><p class="section-kicker"><span>03</span> Investment</p><p>One project.<br />One clear scope.</p></div><div class="pricing-main" data-reveal><span class="pricing-label">CUSTOM DEVELOPMENT</span><p class="price-display"><sup>FROM</sup><strong>$599</strong><span>USD</span></p><p>I base the final quote on scope, complexity and requirements. I’ll walk you through what’s included before we start.</p><ul><li><Icon name="check" /> A scope shaped around your goal</li><li><Icon name="check" /> Custom design and development</li><li><Icon name="check" /> Built for a real launch</li></ul><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Talk through your project <Icon name="arrow" /></a></div><div class="pricing-stamp" aria-hidden="true">NO<br />ONE-SIZE<br />TEMPLATE</div></section>
  <section class="closing-cta page-shell" data-reveal><p class="section-kicker"><span>04</span> Start a conversation</p><h2>What’s the<br /><em>problem?</em></h2><div class="closing-bottom"><p>Tell me what you need to fix, build, or make possible.</p><a href="/contact/" class="closing-arrow" aria-label="Contact Rohit Kumar"><Icon name="arrow" /></a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
